       fhir:ElementDefinition.comment [ fhir:value "An event can further specialize the act inherent in the typeCode, such as where it is simply \"Procedure Report\" and the procedure was a \"colonoscopy\". If one or more eventCodes are included, they SHALL NOT conflict with the values inherent in the classCode, practiceSettingCode or typeCode, as such a conflict would create an ambiguous situation. This short list of codes is provided to be used as key words for certain types of queries." ] ;
